    "implementation_delta": "Publish AcceleratePortfolioCompatibilityLock@1, DatasetsPortfolioCompatibilityLockBinding@1, KitPortfolioCompatibilityLockBinding@1, and PlatformPortfolioCompatibilityLock@1. One declared proof-carrying-platform-0.1.0 lock binds Accelerate 0.0.45, Datasets 0.2.0, and Kit 0.3.0; intended tags; PCPR-053/054/055 artifact CIDs; PCPR-040/041/042/043 catalog, vector, negative, and compatibility-document CIDs; the one supported combination pcpr.v1.python312.accelerate-datasets-kit.shared-contracts-v1 with lock=true; hermetic candidate test suites; and named qualification-receipt identities. Datasets and Kit bind lock CID baguqeerawsekbbbt5ccctjt4tydzeahfkahsatb6q5x7k6cy4inrii5lhqmq and refuse remint without sibling import. Live GPG/SSH/cosign signatures, published wheel/sdist/container identities, CUDA/solver/IPFS/Iroh live qualification, and branch protection stay typed unavailable. Signatures and unpublished artifact hashes were not invented. Mutable origin/main is not the release identity. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
